§ `Form 34 (Section 771) -- Writ of Fieri Facias (lines 18645-18647)`

-- The amount set opposite the name is 1000 dollars. Nothing levied: 1000 still to levy. 400 levied: 600. Exactly 1000 levied: nothing. More than 1000 levied: nothing (never a negative).
#ASSERT `form 34 the amount the sheriff is commanded to levy from the person` TRUE 1000 0 EQUALS JUST 1000
#ASSERT `form 34 the amount the sheriff is commanded to levy from the person` TRUE 1000 400 EQUALS JUST 600
#ASSERT `form 34 the amount the sheriff is commanded to levy from the person` TRUE 1000 999 EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `form 34 the amount the sheriff is commanded to levy from the person` TRUE 1000 1000 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `form 34 the amount the sheriff is commanded to levy from the person` TRUE 1000 1200 EQUALS JUST 0
-- A person not named in the writ: not covered.
#ASSERT `form 34 the amount the sheriff is commanded to levy from the person` FALSE 1000 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `form 34 the sheriff is commanded to make a return` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `form 34 the sheriff is commanded to make a return` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Expected: the sheriff levies, then makes the return: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `form 34 the duties of the sheriff` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a peace officer` DOES `form 34 levy the amount from the person's goods and chattels, lands and tenements` AT 1
    PARTY `a peace officer` DOES `form 34 make a return of what the sheriff has done in execution of the writ` AT 2

§ `Form 40 (Section 629) -- Challenge To Array (line 18807)`

#ASSERT `form 40 the challenge to the array is in the Form's terms` `form 40 the prosecutor` TRUE `form 40 partiality` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `form 40 the challenge to the array is in the Form's terms` `form 40 the accused` TRUE `form 40 fraud` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `form 40 the challenge to the array is in the Form's terms` `form 40 the accused` TRUE `form 40 wilful misconduct` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Anyone else; a panel not returned by a sheriff or deputy sheriff; a ground the Form does not name: not covered.
#ASSERT `form 40 the challenge to the array is in the Form's terms` `form 40 another person` TRUE `form 40 partiality` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `form 40 the challenge to the array is in the Form's terms` `form 40 the accused` FALSE `form 40 partiality` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `form 40 the challenge to the array is in the Form's terms` `form 40 the accused` TRUE `form 40 another ground` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Form 41 (Section 639) -- Challenge for Cause (line 18818)`

#ASSERT `form 41 the challenge for cause is in the Form's terms` `form 41 the prosecutor` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `form 41 the challenge for cause is in the Form's terms` `form 41 the accused` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `form 41 the challenge for cause is in the Form's terms` `form 41 another person` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- The ground is not a ground of subsection 638(1) (fork F9), or s 638(1)'s answer is not covered: not covered here.
#ASSERT `form 41 the challenge for cause is in the Form's terms` `form 41 the accused` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `form 41 the challenge for cause is in the Form's terms` `form 41 the accused` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
